        <mxCell id="llm" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" value="ChatClientInvestigationCaller — UMA chamada, SEM tools&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;system (dado ≠ comando) + user (EvidenceBundle + format do BeanOutputConverter)&lt;br&gt;IDA À REDE: ResilientCaller.chamarComTimeout(&quot;vertex-ai&quot;) — retry + CB + llm-timeout → falha = LlmInvocationException (infra, propaga)&lt;br&gt;CONVERSÃO: BeanOutputConverter.convert() FORA do wrapper → falha = parsing → INVESTIGACAO_FALHOU_PARSING&lt;br&gt;LlmCallRecorder: grava investigation_llm_call + incrementa investigation_budget (tokens + custo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="104" width="600" x="1530" y="1976" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="redact" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" value="RedactionService — redação na ENTRADA&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;redige cada *Facts ANTES de montar o prompt: AWS/Google key, GitLab PAT, JWT, bloco PRIVATE KEY, URI com credencial, Bearer, chave=valor&lt;br&gt;segredo nunca sai pra a Vertex AI · redigiu algo → métrica incidentsentinel.investigation.prompt.redacted + WARN&lt;br&gt;hard cap prompt-max-chars (rede de segurança) → métrica prompt.truncated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="96" width="700" x="399" y="1980" as="geometry" />
